# CQROS Python Standards

## Mission

CQROS is built using modern Python 3.13.

Only approved libraries and language features may be used.

Favor readability, maintainability, reproducibility, and deterministic behavior over clever implementations.

---

# Python Version

Target Version

Python 3.13

Always use modern Python syntax.

Prefer

match/case

pathlib

dataclasses

Enum

Protocol

TypedDict

slots

context managers

Never write legacy compatibility code.

